---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About WordCounterGo — Fast, Free & Private Word Counter"
  description="Learn about WordCounterGo — a free, browser-based word counter that never stores your text. No sign-up needed. Built for writers, students, and professionals."
  canonical="https://wordcountergo.com/about"
>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1 class="page-title">About <span class="accent">WordCounterGo</span></h1><p class="page-subtitle">Simple tools for writers, students, and professionals.</p></div></section>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>WordCounterGo was built with a single goal: give anyone a fast, clean, and completely private way to count words and transform text — without ads, account creation, or unnecessary complexity.</p>
      <p>Writing is hard enough. Your tools should not get in the way. Whether you are a student hitting a minimum word count, a blogger keeping posts scannable, or a developer testing copy, WordCounterGo is here to help — instantly.</p>
      <h2>Privacy by Design</h2>
      <p>Every calculation on WordCounterGo happens entirely in your browser. We do not transmit, store, or analyse your text. There is no server receiving your words. When you close the tab, your text is gone. We believe this is the only acceptable way to handle other people's words.</p>
      <h2>No Account Required</h2>
      <p>We deliberately chose not to add user accounts, subscription tiers, or paywalls. WordCounterGo is and will remain completely free. The only thing you need to do is open the page and start typing.</p>
      <h2>Built for Speed</h2>
      <p>The site is built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="content-link">Astro</a>, a modern web framework that ships zero JavaScript to the browser except the small script needed for the counting tool itself. This means near-instant page loads and a Lighthouse performance score that stays high.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero { padding: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .page-title { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.625rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .accent { color: var(--color-green); }
  .page-subtitle { font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .page-content { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .about-card { background-color: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); padding: 2rem; transition: background-color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition); }
  .about-card h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 1.5rem 0 0.625rem; padding-bottom: 0.375rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); display: inline-block; }
  .about-card h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .about-card p { font-size: var(--text-base); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 0.875rem; }
  .content-link { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent); transition: text-decoration-color var(--transition-fast); }
  .content-link:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--accent); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .about-card { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; } }
</style>
